{"availability":"available","full":"Medialoco/ventoux-watch","name":"ventoux-watch","description":"A Raspberry Pi 5 in Los Angeles watches Mont Ventoux, one frame per second. OpenCV detects motion, YOLO interprets it, and the landscape becomes digital art. Cannes provides a backup view. #FREETECHNORADIO streams 24/7 on YouTube, powered by Creative Commons music from Dogmazic. An experiment in machine vision, uncertainty, and the unexpected.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-25T03:49:54Z","updated":"2026-10-19T00:37:21Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://freetechnoradio.tech","topics":["computer-vision","creative-commons","dogmazic","freetechnoradio","mont-serein","mont-ventoux","opencv","programmez-magazine","raspberry-pi","slow-tv","vaucluse","webcam","yolo","youtube"],"demo":"https://medialoco.github.io/ventoux-watch/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T00:41:56.925Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T00:41:56.925Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T00:41:56.925Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T15:06:04.807Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T19:08:47.345Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T00:41:56.925Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Un Raspberry Pi 5, sur un bureau à Los Angeles, regarde la webcam du col du Mont Serein, à 1 389 m sur le mont Ventoux. Une image par seconde. OpenCV trouve ce qui a bougé, YOLO nomme la découpe, et le Pi reconstruit le cadre : la photographie, le rectangle, les encarts, la musique. La veille est le travail. Le flux est le spectacle.","Trois modes, et chaque caméra est le relais de l’autre.","Le Mont Serein. La playlist est ouverte, le cadre est le col. Cannes attend."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Medialoco/ventoux-watch/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"875a3b61ab9e3fba67bf00a6fdb6b3840ca5ce1ac4ef9df4de3612289cd797ea","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:47.46